      "result": "Perfect! All 26 tests have been completed and recorded. Here's the summary:\n\n## Test Results Summary\n\n**PASS (19 tests):**\n- **Functionality (9):** FT-1, FT-2, FT-3, FT-4, FT-5, FT-6, FT-7, FT-8, FT-9\n- **Functionality (4):** FT-11, FT-12, FT-13, FT-28\n- **Constraints (2):** CS-16, CS-19\n- **Interaction (4):** IX-20, IX-21, IX-22, IX-24\n- **Content (2):** CT-25, CT-26\n\n**FAIL (7 tests):**\n- **Functionality (1):** FT-10 (Typo tolerance in search not implemented)\n- **Constraints (4):** CS-14 (Email validation), CS-17 (Special character handling), CS-27 (Field-placeholder mapping), CS-29 (Duplicate field labels)\n\n## Key Findings\n\n✅ **Strengths:**\n- Template library browsing, filtering, and sorting work excellently\n- Custom template submission with full field definition\n- Real-time search suggestions and favorites functionality\n- Markdown rendering with proper formatting\n- Persistence across page reloads\n- Comprehensive form validation for required fields\n- Dynamic UI updates without page reloads\n\n❌ **Weaknesses:**\n- Search lacks typo tolerance (only exact/partial matches work)\n- Email and date field format validation not enforced\n- Special characters not escaped/rejected in form fields\n- Template field-placeholder mapping not validated\n- Duplicate field labels allowed in custom templates\n\nThe application successfully delivers the core template library functionality with good UX, but would benefit from stricter input validation and search fuzzy matching.",
